{"c":[{"name":"20261020T193116Z-270eb1650c4e7f96","text":"semantic and embed restore torch once from a usable hashed freeze and retry; no freeze, a failed restore, or any other encoder failure says re-run sr-initialize. doctor smoke stays report-only and still names ensure-env when a freeze exists.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261020T205704Z-a2498a1e20047fe3","text":"Nightly cron and launchd payload is (date; stockroom shim ensure-env; stockroom ingest && stockroom embed). A failed heal still ingests; a failed ingest still skips embed.","type":"note"}]}
